{"title":"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/0/3001f8ca4ba92117ea7cbc8ce8b98a54d00f9b62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a@b = ab - b^{2}$\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844838873e2f9f1afc1053795f8d6e10b67bea34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\#b = a + b - ab^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f4c55991491fcb82afadd5d19474a0b7539bccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {6@2}{6\\#2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"35\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a97d9015d43afb56a01cbd1ef64aa583abcc6a52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ - \\frac {1}{2}\\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ - \\frac {1}{4}\\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac {1}{8}\\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac {1}{4}\\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac {1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"397\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7541531833ff6358250ac6796327414a2ad1e8ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6@2$\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> must be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f72dd26dc28445b623ee8839711017cc0e7ae8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6*2-2^2$\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" /> which is 8. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48ec4d369c3f5624c91ce4163cc8cf9548493f9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\# 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/4/3e4dbf07bd487429fa07cd50327e6b1629bb11a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+2-6*2^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/5/1e55578ccf9d13ad09cdcce181f0853a349018da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8-24 = -16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/c/5bcdbe691ceafd760fdaf79de3825367e4cada62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6@2}{6\\# 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"35\" height=\"41\" /> must be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/c/82c9e4bd3061c0ca8afec87e7068ffda0a50c626.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{-16} = -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore the solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A\">2007 AM